#: src/main.glade:423 src/onboarding.glade:111
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "ቁልፍ መደወል / KWallet ራስ-መክፈቻ"

#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"የመግቢያ ቁልፍ መክፈቻዎን ወይም KWallet በመግቢያ ጊዜ ለመክፈት የፊት ማረጋገጥን ያንቁ። ይህ ሲገኝ የይለፍ ቃልዎን "
"በ TPM ውስጥ ደህንነቱ በተጠበቀ ሁኔታ ያከማቻል ወይም በ AES-256-GCM የተመሰጠረ ስርወ-ብቻ ዋና ቁልፍ። Face "
"auth እንደ ዴስክቶፕዎ ላይ በመመስረት PAM_AUTHTOK ለpam_gnome_keyring ወይም pam_kwallet5 "
"ያዘጋጃል።"

#: src/main.glade:471
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "የአሁኑ ሁኔታ፡"

#: src/main.glade:486
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "በማጣራት ላይ..."

#: src/main.glade:509
